se either “System default browser” or a specific browser, such as “Microsoft Edge.” “System default browser” refers to the browser setting specified on the user’s Windows device.\r\n\r\nIf you disable or don’t configure this policy, web links will open in Microsoft Edge. The user can set their preferred browser from the settings for the specific Microsoft 365 app.\r\n\r\nFor more information, see https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/p/?linkid=2224834.","categoryId":"94ce8206-be22-496c-aa72-f3560e2a5c8d","baseUri":"./User/Vendor/MSFT/Policy","offsetUri":"/Config/office16v14~Policy~L_MicrosoftOfficeSystem~L_M365LinksHandling/L_M365LinksBrowserChoice","rootDefinitionId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_office16v14~policy~l_microsoftofficesystem~l_m365linkshandling_l_m365linksbrowserchoice","uxBehavior":"toggle","applicability":{"platform":"windows10","technologies":"mdm"},"defaultOptionId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_office16v14~policy~l_microsoftofficesystem~l_m365linkshandling_l_m365linksbrowserchoice_0","options":[{"itemId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_office16v14~policy~l_microsoftofficesystem~l_m365linkshandling_l_m365linksbrowserchoice_0","displayName":"Disabled","dependedOnBy":[]},{"itemId":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_office16v14~policy~l_microsoftofficesystem~l_m365linkshandling_l_m365linksbrowserchoice_1","displayName":"Enabled","dependedOnBy":[{"dependedOnBy":"user_vendor_msft_policy_config_office16v14~policy~l_microsoftofficesystem~l_m365linkshandling_l_m365linksbrowserchoice_l_browserchoiceenum","required":true}]}]}]